# Soft Summer Palette Guide

Documentation and resource hub for [Soft Summer Palette](https://softsummerpalette.com).

## Overview
Soft Summer sits between True Summer and Soft Autumn in the 16-season color system. It is characterized by cool undertones with low contrast and a muted, desaturated chroma.

